{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tokyo International Airport (Haneda) \u2013 Ultimate Realism &amp; Performance</strong><br>Experience Tokyo International Airport (HND | RJTT) like never before! Located in Ota, Tokyo, just 17 km from the city center, Haneda is Japan\u2019s largest and busiest airport, serving as a key international hub. Originally built in 1931, it now features three terminals and four runways, with a brand-new terminal opening on March 20, 2025!<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the new Terminal Opening in March 2025 \u2013 Be among the first to explore it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latest AIRAC 2503 Data \u2013 Stay up-to-date with the most accurate layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless X-Plane Jetway Support \u2013 For a smoother ground experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K Textures \u2013 Crisp, high-resolution visuals for maximum realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly Detailed Terminal &amp; Airport Buildings \u2013 Faithfully recreated from real-world data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Terrain, Ground Markings &amp; Lighting \u2013 Elevate your immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True-to-Life Vehicles &amp; Ground Services \u2013 Bringing the airport to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate taxiway and runway according to the newest AIRAC data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for Performance \u2013 Stunning visuals with FPS-friendly design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No more waiting\u00a0\u2013\u00a0experience Haneda Airport NOW!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970850?t=1761810342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970850?t=1761810342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass